node_modules
.next
.git
*.md
.env*.local
coverage
playwright-report
test-results

# Secrets / credentials — must never be baked into the image (defence in
# depth for docker:S6470; the recursive `COPY . .` below relies on this).
# Note: plain `.env` / `.env.production` are intentionally NOT excluded —
# Next.js reads them at build time and they hold only public defaults.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
.secrets/
*.secret
